# REAL IDS ONTO THE EMITTED SHELL.
#
# The export contains one page per dynamic route (`/communities/index/`), not one per
# record — see the server wrappers for why baking real ids into a static build would both
# go stale and publish them. These rewrites send a real path to that shell with a 200, so
# the id stays in the address bar for the client to read at runtime.
#
# Order matters: the more specific analytics rule has to precede the catch-all above it.
/communities/*/analytics  /communities/index/analytics/  200
/communities/*            /communities/index/            200
/users/*                  /users/index/                  200
/events/*                 /events/index/                 200
